+// The NONE kernels count one 64-bit word at a time, which aarch64 does with
+// cnt + addv through the vector unit. Long rows count 16 bytes per cnt into
+// per-plane lane sums and reduce them once per block. The sums are exact and
+// equal to the NONE kernels'.
